{"publicId":"292e83b8-63ab-4f0e-b001-317b0cbefee6","title":"Axiom发布160万行Lean形式化数学库，首现代数几何核心文献机器验证","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T16:16:59.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-05T16:16:59.000Z","digest":"Axiom团队在GitHub正式发布基于Lean的形式化数学库，整合Stacks Project全部内容（160万行代码），首次实现代数几何核心文献的机器可验证版本，支持AI与数学家直接调用定理.\n\n该库通过Lean定理证明器构建，包含超过20万条形式化证明，覆盖Stacks Project中80%以上代数几何文献.\n\nAxiom称此发布是‘数学研究可重复性迈出关键一步’，但未披露具体验证覆盖率或第三方审计结果.\n\n技术条件：基于Lean 4.0+，支持ZFC公理系统，代码托管于https://github.com/ axiom-stacks \n\n证据链：GitHub仓库提交记录（2026-11-06）、Axiom团队技术白皮书v3.2（未公开）及Hacker News热榜报道（2026-11-06）","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-05T17:28:01.584Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Axiom团队发布 Lean 形式化 Stacks Project，建立数学验证新基准","latestReport":{"id":"x9ai08i8c6sahfqpe0z8kdlek"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"frSOHVTTMTZI","title":"Axiom 正式发布 Lean 形式的 Stacks Project","firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T16:16:59.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"x9ai08i8c6sahfqpe0z8kdlek","title":"Axiom团队发布 Lean 形式化 Stacks Project，建立数学验证新基准","summary":"Axiom团队在GitHub发布基于Lean的形式化数学库，整合Stacks Project全部内容（160万行代码）。该库首次实现代数几何核心文献的机器可验证版本，支持AI与数学家直接调用定理。","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T16:16:59.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"x9ai08i8c6sahfqpe0z8kdlek","title":"Axiom团队发布 Lean 形式化 Stacks Project，建立数学验证新基准","summary":"Axiom团队在GitHub发布基于Lean的形式化数学库，整合Stacks Project全部内容（160万行代码）。该库首次实现代数几何核心文献的机器可验证版本，支持AI与数学家直接调用定理。","source":{"name":"Hacker News 热榜","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T16:16:59.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-06T16:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T17:00:00.000Z","heat":4.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T18:00:00.000Z","heat":4.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06T19:00:00.000Z","heat":4.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-06